      "message": "Here is the local test result. Although the result is positive, I think that there may be all linear skb cases. Not sure how to generate a skb with non-linear portion.\n\n\nSummary:\nTest {ping, iperf} with clatd launched from {system server, netd}\n- ping + mainline clatd: [pass]\n  (clat ingress is dropped in ip6tables bw_raw_PREROUTING)\n- iperf + mainline clatd: [pass]\n  (ip6tables bw_raw_PREROUTING see clat packet)\n- ping + netd clatd: [pass]\n  (clat ingress is dropped in ip6tables clat_raw_PREROUTING)\n- iperf + netd clatd: [pass]\n  (ip6tables clat_raw_PREROUTING and bw_raw_PREROUTING doesn\u0027t see clat packet)\n\n  ---------------------------------------------\n  \nTests:\nA. Test with clatd launched from system server (uses unmerged aosp/1951099)\n\n0. Connect to IPv6-only wifi\n\n1. Clatd test: ping 5 times and check that iptables drop 5 packets by\n   mark 0xdeadc1a7.\n\n$ adb shell ping 8.8.8.8\nPING 8.8.8.8 (8.8.8.8) 56(84) bytes of data.\n64 bytes from 8.8.8.8: icmp_seq\u003d1 ttl\u003d120 time\u003d22.9 ms\n64 bytes from 8.8.8.8: icmp_seq\u003d2 ttl\u003d120 time\u003d21.3 ms\n64 bytes from 8.8.8.8: icmp_seq\u003d3 ttl\u003d120 time\u003d74.5 ms\n64 bytes from 8.8.8.8: icmp_seq\u003d4 ttl\u003d120 time\u003d17.8 ms\n64 bytes from 8.8.8.8: icmp_seq\u003d5 ttl\u003d120 time\u003d72.0 ms\n\n$ adb shell ip6tables -t raw -L bw_raw_PREROUTING -v\nChain bw_raw_PREROUTING (1 references)\n pkts bytes target     prot opt in     out     source               destination         \n    5   520 DROP       all      any    any     anywhere             anywhere             mark match 0xdeadc1a7\n    0     0 RETURN     all      ipsec+ any     anywhere             anywhere            \n    0     0 RETURN     all      any    any     anywhere             anywhere             policy match dir in pol ipsec\n 1152  929K            all      any    any     anywhere             anywhere            match bpf pinned /sys/fs/bpf/prog_netd_skfilter_ingress_xt