      "message": "Also \u0027another_round\u0027 is only triggered in the case we successfully xlat64 translate the packet and call \u0027bpf_redirect()\u0027 in which case since the packet was already heavily modified (headers were changed) it is already an uncloned header writable packet, so there is no real change in behaviour (in this case).",
